ACME example license (docs/08 §7 reference tree)

This is example code shipped with Astro to demonstrate the external-tree
contract. Use, copy, modify, and redistribute it freely, with or without
attribution. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

(cbuild note: a "custom:" license id requires the license text to be
installed via self.install_license — pkg lint 098 enforces it.)
